WEBVTT

00:17:00.162 --> 00:17:03.996
And I you know, I wanted to be popular
because to be popular is to be loved.

00:17:04.329 --> 00:17:05.913
I wanted people to love me.

00:17:06.746 --> 00:17:09.746
Now, let's talk a little bit about books,
because you've written about how,

00:17:09.746 --> 00:17:13.496
as you were growing up, books were
your religion and you cited

00:17:13.496 --> 00:17:17.371
the experience of reading Dalton Trumbo
novel Johnny Got His Gun is

00:17:17.371 --> 00:17:21.913
a book that first exposed you
to the power of inhabiting

00:17:21.913 --> 00:17:25.704
the life of another human. Yeah.
What was that like for you?

00:17:25.746 --> 00:17:28.788
How did how did that infuse who you were?

00:17:29.121 --> 00:17:33.829
Johnny got his gun. Dalton Trumbo, really,
really powerfully important book.